From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Turcios <turcioskevinr@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add HyperSwap swap models

FaceFusion Labs' HyperSwap (1a, 1b, 1c; 256 px) beside InSwapper 128,
selected with modules.globals.swap_model (default hyperswap_1c_256) or
--swap-model. HyperSwapper puts the model behind the INSwapper interface
the pipeline uses; it also predicts an occlusion-aware face mask, returned
as the crop's alpha channel and used by the paste-back. The models
download from FaceFusion's asset releases, which model_downloader now
knows by name; the execution-provider setup is shared by both models.

Reconstructed from Deep-Live-Cam branch headless-library at 047c551,
which Applio vendored on 2026-11-12; that branch was never pushed, so its
own history is lost.
